## English Version

### 1. Overview
Welcome to **Huda Quran** ("we", "our", or "us"). We are committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains our practices regarding data collection, usage, and disclosure for our mobile application.

### 2. Data Collection and Usage
- **No Personal Data Collected:** Huda Quran is designed as an offline-first, privacy-focused application. We do not require account creation, registration, or any personal identification details (such as your name, email address, phone number, or location).
- **No Tracking or Analytics:** We do not track your activity, use third-party analytics services, or share any data with third parties.

### 3. Local Storage Preferences
The app saves reading preferences strictly on your local device storage using standard device storage mechanisms (`SharedPreferences`):
- Last read Surah and Ayah position (for continuing reading).
- Font size, font style (e.g., bold), and visual display mode preferences.

This data remains strictly on your physical device and is never uploaded, transmitted, or backed up to external servers by our app.

### 4. Device Permissions
Huda Quran does not request any sensitive permissions such as location, contacts, camera, or microphone.

### 5. Third-Party Services
Our application does not integrate third-party advertising SDKs, tracking tools, or external backend servers.

### 6. Children's Privacy
Huda Quran does not address or target anyone under the age of 13 specifically, but as a Quranic reading application, it contains no inappropriate content and collects no information from children or adults.

### 7. Changes to This Privacy Policy
We may update our Privacy Policy from time to time. Any updates will be posted in this file with an updated effective date.

### 8. Contact Us
If you have any questions or suggestions about our Privacy Policy, please contact us at:  
- **Email:** support@hudaquran.app (or your developer email)

